undled catalog（P1，silent cost regression 5-6x）\n- **#57536** - [Bug]: feishu:tenant_a\n\nSource: memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md-SCAN-LOG-2026-03-30-06-55.md#L1-L31","source":"memory","citation":"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md-SCAN-LOG-2026-03-30-06-55.md#L1-L31"},{"id":"30028d86d604edeb0aa9cb632008973f7f9a133223942517c67103d92177313f","path":"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md","startLine":258,"endLine":304,"score":0.7681268233729597,"textScore":0.7681268233729597,"snippet":"- **推荐**：aoao 修复\n- **来源**：GitHub issues\n\n**#58411** - sessions_spawn lacks --bind here equivalent — agent cannot bind ACP session to existing Discord thread\n- **类型**：enhancement\n- **严重度**：中（功能缺失）\n- **root cause**：sessions_spawn 缺少 --bind here 等价物\n- **影响**：\n  1. Agent 无法将 ACP session 绑定到现有的 Discord thread\n  2. ACP 集成功能受限\n- **可修性**：M\n- **推荐**：aoao 修复\n- **来源**：GitHub issues\n\n**#58423** - [Bug] webchat channel: file attachments not passed to AI context via chat.send\n- **类型**：bug\n- **严重度**：中（webchat 文件附件问题）\n- **root cause**：webchat channel 中文件附件没有通过 chat.send 传递给 AI 上下文\n- **影响**：\n  1. Webchat 用户无法上传文件\n  2. 文件分析功能失效\n- **可修性**：M\n- **推荐**：aoao 修复\n- **来源**：GitHub issues\n\n#### InStreet 社区发现\n\n无（访问的是 AP\n\nSource: memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L258-L304","source":"memory","citation":"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L258-L304"},{"id":"edfc84cef32526d1f14ebf02065be12f1fde65b5d9ede7bbe617bb187bf05867","path":"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md","startLine":227,"endLine":265,"score":0.7681268233729597,"textScore":0.7681268233729597,"snippet":"- **root cause**：Plugin subagent calls 间歇性失败，提示\"Plugin runtime subagent methods are only available during a gateway request.\"\n- **影响**：\n  1. Plugin subagent 调用不稳定\n  2. 某些 plugin 功能间歇性失效\n  3. 用户体验不可预测\n- **可修性**：M\n- **推荐**：aoao 修复\n- **来源**：GitHub issues\n\n#### P2 - Medium 优先级问题\n\n**#58416** - [Bug]: Voice call plugin TTS config\n- **类型**：bug\n- **严重度**：中（Voice call plugin TTS 配置问题）\n- **root cause**：Voice call plugin TTS 配置有问题\n- **影响**：\n  1. Voice call TTS 功能可能失效\n  