{"type":"message","id":"b52cc947","parentId":"1a13f529","timestamp":"2026-04-01T16:04:02.018Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_eHaKBjm6QxmVz0b8uvZiJfQU|fc_05a6eafc242db68f0169cd41f10ed0819195186fdf0ced678e","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"- **可修性**：M\n- **推荐**：aoao 修复\n- **来源**：GitHub issues\n\n**#52186** - [Bug]: TTS elevenlabs provider generates audio but OpenClaw plays OpenAI voice instead\n- **类型**：bug + regression\n- **严重度**：中（TTS elevenlabs provider 失效）\n- **root cause**：ElevenLabs API 处理成功，但 OpenClaw 播放 OpenAI 语音\n- **影响**：\n  1. TTS 配置失效\n  2. 即使用户配置了 elevenlabs，也会使用 OpenAI voice\n- **可修性**：M\n- **推荐**：aoao 修复\n- **来源**：GitHub issues\n\n#### InStreet 社区发现\n\n**n8n + Browser-use 内网穿透问题**\n- **来源**：InStreet 社区讨论（\"实战求教：今天尝试用 n8n + Browser-use 搭建免服务器的电商监控，卡在内网穿透了求指点\"）\n- **问题**：\n  1. 用户尝试用 n8n + Browser-use 搭建免服务器电商监控\n  2. 卡在内网穿透和飞书 Webhook 鉴权上\n  3. 发现 Cloudflare 免费版有 404 拦截\n  4. 临时用了 ssh 反向隧道\n  5. 询问社区有没有更优雅的方案\n- **可修性**：N/A（社区讨论）\n- **推荐**：可能需要在 OpenClaw 中添加 n8n 集成文档或改进内网穿透支持\n\n---\n\n## 当前优先级表格\n\n| #   | 类型 | 标题 | 优先级 | 状态 | 备注 |\n|-----|------|------|--------|------|------|\n| 58457 | bug+regression | [Bug]: Ollama Cloud provider returns HTTP 401 despite valid API key (v2026.3.28) | P1 | 未覆盖 | Ollama Cloud provider 完全失效（来源：GitHub issues） |\n| 58437 | bug+regression | [Bug]: Live session model switch detection causes infinite retry loop, deadlocking entire agent | P1 | 未覆盖 | Live session model switch 检测导致无限重试，agent 死锁（来源：GitHub issues） |\n| 58443 | bug | [Bug]: Gateway duplicates inbound messages — same message injected multiple times into session | P2 | 未覆盖 | Gateway 重复注入同一条消息到 session（来源：GitHub issues） |\n| 58433 | bug | [Bug]: [Windows] Path character loss bug - \"system\" becomes \"ystem\" in file paths | P2 | 未覆盖 | Windows 文件路径字符丢失（来源：GitHub issues） |\n| 58430 | bug | Feishu TTS: 语音消息应发送为 audio 类型而非 file 类型 | P2 | 未覆盖 | Feishu TTS 语音消息类型错误（来源：GitHub issues） |\n| 58409 | bug+data loss | [Bug]: [CRITICAL] Heartbeat System Causes Silent Session Reset - User Data Loss | P0 | 未覆盖 | Heartbeat 系统导致静默会话重置，用户会话被意外重置，数据丢失（来源：GitHub issues） |\n| 58428 | bug+routing | [Bug] resolveHeartbeatSession fallback causes heartbeat to route to agent:main:main instead of target session | P1 | 未覆盖 | resolveHeartbeatSession fallback 导致 heartbeat 路由到 agent:main:main 而不是目标会话（来源：GitHub issues） |\n| 58427 | bug | [Bug]: Plugin subagent calls intermittently fail with \"Plugin runtime subagent methods are only available during a gateway request.\" | P1 | 未覆盖 | Plugin subagent calls 间歇性失败，提示\"Plugin runtime subagent methods are only available during a gateway request.\"（来源：GitHub issues） |\n| 58416 | bug | [Bug]: Voice call plugin TTS config | P2 | 未覆盖 | Voice call plugin TTS 配置有问题（来源：GitHub issues） |\n| 58415 | bug | [Bug]: ws-stream WebSocket connect fails with 500 and always falls back to HTTP (Telegram still works) | P2 | 未覆盖 | ws-stream WebSocket 连接返回 500，总是回退到 HTTP（来源：GitHub issues） |\n| 58411 | enhancement | sessions_spawn lacks --bind here equivalent — agent cannot bind ACP session to existing Discord thread | P2 | 未覆盖 | sessions_spawn 缺少 --bind here 等价物（来源：GitHub issues） |\n| 58423 | bug | [Bug] webchat channel: file attachments not passed to AI context via chat.send | P2 | 未覆盖 | webchat channel 中文件附件没有通过 chat.send 传递给 AI 上下文（来源：GitHub issues） |\n| 58272 | bug | [Bug]: macOS Path Resolution: ENOENT on both mixed-character directories AND mixed-character filenames (CJK + ASCII) | P1 | 未覆盖 | macOS 上混字符目录和文件名路径解析失败（来源：GitHub issues） |\n| 58189 | bug | [Bug]: When I use VLLM to deploy QWEN3-32B, I get stuck in a loop | P1 | 未覆盖 | VLLM 模型无限循环（来源：GitHub issues） |\n| 58268 | bug | [Bug]: Slack socket-mode mentions silently dropped as no-mention after stale-socket reconnect | P1 | 未覆盖 | Slack socket-mode 在 reconnect 后 mentions 被静默丢弃（来源：GitHub issues） |\n| 58249 | bug+regression | [Bug]: Teams webhook broken in 2026.3.24+: publicUrl removed breaks JWT validation | P1 | 未覆盖 | Teams webhook 完全失效（来源：G