{"type":"message","id":"9deb45d5","parentId":"4fc24e36","timestamp":"2026-04-01T16:04:55.927Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_fI3ETxOsQ2RNwLCVHpkEsDIH|fc_05a6eafc242db68f0169cd422477288191a6a2735fe1fb5db6","toolName":"web_search","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"query\": \"site:github.com openclaw-weixin issues openclaw plugin issues\",\n  \"provider\": \"tavily\",\n  \"count\": 10,\n  \"tookMs\": 1883,\n  \"externalContent\": {\n    \"untrusted\": true,\n    \"source\": \"web_search\",\n    \"provider\": \"tavily\",\n    \"wrapped\": true\n  },\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"c6baf9771db5e1b2\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n[Bug]: External openclaw-weixin plugin fails to load on 2026.3.14\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"c6baf9771db5e1b2\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/52341\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"cb738e5bd56d1b45\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n# [Bug]: External openclaw-weixin plugin fails to load on 2026.3.14 #52341. [[Bug]: External openclaw-weixin plugin fails to load on 2026.3.14](#top)#52341. After installing `@tencent-weixin/openclaw-weixin@1.0.2` into a local OpenClaw `2026.3.14` source checkout on macOS 26.2, the Weixin plugin does not load consistently: gateway startup logs `Cannot find module 'openclaw/plugin-sdk'` or `Cannot find module 'openclaw/plugin-sdk/core'`, and CLI plugin loading logs `TypeError: (0 , _pluginSdk.resolvePreferredOpenClawTmpDir) is not a function`. 5. Observe plugin load failures instead of a stable running Weixin channel. After installation and QR login, the external Weixin plugin should load under both gateway startup and CLI/plugin-registry loading, and `channels status` should show a running Weixin account without plugin load errors. * `Error: Cannot find module 'openclaw/plugin-sdk'`. Related existing issue: #52153 is about proactive sending on Weixin; this report is about plugin loading / SDK compatibility before normal runtime behavior. Affected: local/source OpenClaw installs using the external `@tencent-weixin/openclaw-weixin` plugin. Consequence: The Weixin plugin does not load reliably, so the channel cannot be used normally.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"cb738e5bd56d1b45\\\">>>\",\n      \"score\": 0.8815438\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"6bd21c64fe3f39e0\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n[Feature]: channel to wechat · Issue #31345 - GitHub\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"6bd21c64fe3f39e0\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/31345\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"abac8c110f0189d6\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nhttps://github.com/lovezm/iopenclawwx ，I developed a plugin for junior high school level, which enables OpenClaw to connect with WeChat mini-\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"abac8c110f0189d6\\\">>>\",\n      \"score\": 0.82761955\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"f7ebc2f9e5928f62\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n安装出错，不知道哪里的问题 · Issue #6 · freestylefly/openclaw-wechat\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"f7ebc2f9e5928f62\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/freestylefly/openclaw-wechat/issues/6\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"58c064f2cdee53a5\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n[openclaw] Failed to start CLI: Error: Config validation failed: plugins.entries.openclaw-wechat: plugin not found: openclaw-wechat at\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"58c064f2cdee53a5\\\">>>\",\n      \"score\": 0.80771893\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"34a8ba9c73bfaeb3\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nFeature Request: WeCom (Enterprise WeChat) Plugin Support\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"34a8ba9c73bfaeb3\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/40778\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"97e5997a2bfcbc79\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nYou signed in with another tab or window. You signed out in another tab or window. # Feature Request: WeCom (Enterprise WeChat) Plugin Support #40778. Feature Request: WeCom (Enterprise WeChat) Plugin Support#40778. ## Feature Request: WeCom (Enterprise WeChat) Plugin Support. OpenClaw currently supports various instant messaging platforms (WhatsApp, Telegram, Slack, Discord, Feishu, etc.), but lacks native support for WeCom (Enterprise WeChat). WeCom is widely used in Chinese enterprise environments, and many users wish to use OpenClaw assistant within WeCom. 1. **WeCom Bot Plugin**: Support integration via WeCom's Webhook API or SDK. 3. **Group Support**: Support usage in WeCom group chats. 4. **Authentication**: Support WeCom app secret authentication. * Use WeCom's group bot Webhook API. * Use WeCom's official Node.js SDK. * Requires WeCom administrator permissions for configuration. * Reference existing Feishu plugin architecture (`@openclaw/feishu`). * WeCom and Feishu APIs have similar designs, allowing code reuse. * Community already has experience maintaining Feishu plugin. 2. WeCom Node.js SDK:. 3. Existing Feishu Plugin: `/usr/lib/node_modules/openclaw/extensions/feishu/`.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"97e5997a2bfcbc79\\\">>>\",\n      \"score\": 0.78194773\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"d019205db0fa6f86\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n[Bug] WeChat plugin cannot receive messages #50893 - GitHub\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"d019205db0fa6f86\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/50893\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"e6ac2694e1771aac\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n# Search code, repositories, users, issues, pull requests... You signed in with another tab or window. You signed out in another tab or window. You switched accounts on another tab or window. * Notifications  You must be signed in to change notification settings. # [Bug] WeChat plugin cannot receive messages #50893. [[Bug] WeChat plugin cannot receive messages](#top)#50893. WeChat plugin installed via QClaw plugin store cannot receive messages. It can send messages normally, but messages from contacts are not received at all. * WeChat Version: 3.9.x. 1. Install WeChat plugin from QClaw plugin store. 2. Configure WeChat with valid credentials. 3. Attempt to receive messages from contacts. 4. Messages are never received. Should be able to receive WeChat messages from contacts in real-time. * Cannot receive any incoming messages. * Plugin appears to only support one-way communication. ### Fields. No fields configured for issues without a type. No branches or pull requests. ## Issue actions. You can’t perform that action at this time.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"e6ac2694e1771aac\\\">>>\",\n      \"score\": 0.76659125\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"d97183b254c8de55\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n[Feature]: WeChat channel setup for Moltbot · Issue #3694 - GitHub\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"d97183b254c8de55\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/3694\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"4f49e5969ddb8c24\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nOpenClaw Maintainer Triage // Issue Closure. Hi — this is a joint maintainer effort to keep the repo moving. We're currently seeing ~30 new\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"4f49e5969ddb8c24\\\">>>\",\n      \"score\": 0.7646988\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"451d427856ecd681\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n[Bug]: In wechat page, always show compacting context.... #39908\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id