8e-9977-58fbb445bc65","agent:main:subagent:c3e36502-ee4e-4d91-9234-5f39e8e5e0ef","agent:main:subagent:ee05d3ae-111d-4e2e-8ecd-af6ffbe855f0"],"systemSent":true,"abortedLastRun":false,"lastChannel":"feishu","lastTo":"user:ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8","lastAccountId":"default","transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/16b859d4-1a91-40c7-838a-dcb91a6d4974.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":""},{"type":"text","text":"收到，这轮优先级我直接拍板：\n\n## 最高优先级\n### 1. #59045\n**v2026.3.31 在 loopback + token auth 下 exec 全失效**\n\n这比别的都急。  \n原因很简单：**exec 是基础能力**，单机 / loopback operator 直接废掉，影响面非常大。\n\n链接：  \nhttps://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/59045\n\n### 2. #59052\n**Apple Silicon 上 gateway 10-60 秒内崩溃**\n\n这是启动级 crash，也很重，但我还是把它排在 #59045 后面。  \n因为 #59045 是“现有链路普遍失能”，#59052 更偏特定平台高危。\n\n链接：  \nhttps://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/59052\n\n## 次级关注\n### #59006\n**exec/sandbox 迁移文档与默认行为存在 usability gap**\n\n这个不是先救火项，但很适合在修完 exec 回归后顺手补 docs / migration guidance。\n\n链接：  \nhttps://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/59006\n\n## 我建议的拆法\n- **线 A：exec 认证 / 配对 / loopback 回归**\n  - 主查 **#59045**\n  - 顺带把 #59006 一起看，避免只修行为不补文档\n- **线 B：Apple Silicon crash**\n  - 主查 **#59052**\n  - 重点看 `matrix native binary / code signing / resource leak`\n\n## 结论\n这轮就别分散了，顺序很明确：\n\n**先 #59045，再 #59052，最后顺手补 #59006。**\n\n如果你要，我下一条可以直接给你整理成一版：\n**“截至现在全部高优 issue 作战面板（已修 / 在修 / 新增待打）”**。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_004b85437a29b0680169cd25fd44788191bb862ce854d17daa\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":91569,"output":452,"totalTokens":92021,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":{"total":0.23570250000000004}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775052276716,"responseId":"resp_004b85437a29b0680169cd25f533848191989fb5b8f70acc7f","__openclaw":{"id":"63b6b0d8","seq":697}}]},{"key":"agent:xixi:cron:6f8bd6c8-5b5f-4cf7-8e6f-3479fd23fc64","kind":"other","ch